            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Biển Dương 6",
            "review_text": "Thanh Bằng\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12 contributions\n0\nGreat seafood, fast service, good value!\nApr 2025 • Family\nFresh and tasty seafood with a wide variety of dishes. The grilled lobster and crab in tamarind sauce are must-tries. Friendly staff, quick service, and a spacious dining area. Reasonable prices for the quality. Great for family dinners or casual hangouts.\nInsider tip:\nTry the grilled lobster and the female crab with roe — both are delicious.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 7, 2025\nNhà Hàng Biển Dương\nThank you so much for your kind words and for taking the time to share your experience! We're thrilled to hear that you enjoyed our grilled lobster and crab in tamarind sauce. It's wonderful to know that our service and atmosphere met your expectations. We hope to welcome you back soon for more delicious seafood!\nRead more\nWritten May 7, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
