            "review_text": "Yosef Chen\n6 contributions\n0\nVery expensive seafoods\nApr 2019 • Friends\nWe ordered 2 normal size crabs, 4 large size mantis shrimp, grill cutterfish, 1 kg of snail, and a shell fish (which cost VND1Million).\n\nWhen the bill arrived, it was not itemised and the total cost was VND4.5 Million for 4 persons.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 7, 2019\nNhà Hàng Biển Dương\nBien Duong Restaurant would like to express its sincere gratitude to you for always trusting, loving, and supporting us in the past time.\n\nBien Duong Restaurant feels extremely sorry for the experience this time was not as good as expected. We will fix the mistake that should not have happened this time, to bring the best experience for you next time.\n\nPlease give direct feedback to the Marketing Hotline: 089 660 3388 or send a direct message to the Facebook Fanpage of Bien Duong Restaurant, so that the restaurant can promptly handle the problem this time of you immediately.\nPlease do not rush to give a 3-star rating for this unexpected carelessness, dear customers.\nRead more\nWritten November 21, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
